      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756881384856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Saliency Maps：是一种图像，其中像素的亮度表示该像素对于神经网络所做的预测的显着性（或重要性） ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Saliency Maps：是一种图像，其中像素的亮度表示该像素对于神经网络所做的预测的显着性（或重要性） ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7Oq-2KNaaUDlsL3o_zEkm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 171,
      "y": 618,
      "width": 1210.07958984375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1514359995,
      "version": 38,
      "versionNonce": 1130731381,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756881429997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Class Activation Maps(CAM)：使用来自神经网络倒数第二个卷积层的梯度信息，为该层中存在的每个神经元分配显着性/重要性分数。 ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Class Activation Maps(CAM)：使用来自神经网络倒数第二个卷积层的梯度信息，为该层中存在的每个神经元分配显着性/重要性分数。 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZQgLNa026dgOCR1Bwdyb0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 172,
      "y": 654,
      "width": 1228.15966796875,
